Z||000000||85ZainoGT||09-27-2001||08:34 PM||||$100 ticket, I was drivin my friends 1998 t/a, got a ticket for an UNSAFE start... how gay is that, I barely spun the tires, he said I put the petal to the floor, and was sideways... gay, but I got a question...  If I dont want my parents to find out, they dont gotta right?  if I pay it, then they dont know a thing about it?  ||||reg||11
