Z||000003||kempo||09-27-2001||08:43 PM||||If you pay it, it'll still show up on your driving record, and your insurance will go up.  Fight it in court.  Usually, just for showing up in court, you can almost always work out a deal to lessen (or rid) the offense.  Good luck.||||reg||1
