Z||000007||fierospeeder||09-27-2001||10:55 PM||||On your ticket, does it have a thing that says you can go to traffic school??<P>Im not sure how the law is in indiana.  <BR>but in illinois, when you get a ticket, the cop takes your license and you get it in the mail,  thats when your parents find out.<P>If its just an ordinary ticket, just go to the courthouse and pay it.  You will get a receipt and your license back, if thats how indiana does it.  ||||reg||1
