Z||000009||kempo||09-27-2001||11:17 PM||||I really think that you should tell your parents, because if you don't and they do find out, they'd be that much more pissed off.  Now, as for the ticket goes, go to court and your arguement would be, how can one determine what an "unsafe start" would be?  Bring your friend that was with you, or any witnessess on your side and say that you were in complete control of the car, and that you never lost control, and did not smoke the tires.  But there's really no way out of having your parents not know about it- because your insurance will go up, a hell of a lot, especially because you're only 16.  Also look into what fierospeeder said about the driving school thing, you may get lucky.  Never pay a ticket if you don't absolutely have to.  Speaking of which, I am going to court soon to defend myself from a  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> ticket... "Illegal Decal Affixed to the Front Windshield"||||reg||1
Z||000010||stimpy||09-27-2001||11:22 PM||||Now, was that gay in the sense that it was a time of frolic and merriment, or gay in the sense that you engaged in same sex carnal relations? Not that there is anything wrong with that if that's what floats your dingy, but it would help me get a better idea of the whole tone of the story.||||reg||1
Z||000011||Coop88||09-27-2001||11:24 PM||||Find out if you can get a diversion. I got one in Muncie when I got pulled over by the campus police. It may be more expensive than the ticket itself, but you won't pay extra in insurance when your rates go up. The ticket won't go on your record. ||||reg||1
Z||000012||JetroGT||09-27-2001||11:47 PM||||Go to court. Just tell them that you never drove a car like that before, and you did'nt know that it would do that.||||reg||1
Z||000013||Formula||09-28-2001||12:16 AM||||My insurance has never went up for the $90 tickets that they give you for stupid things.  If you didnt get any points then I dont think your insurance goes up.  I might be wrong, but my insurance is less then all of my friends with 2 cars (1 sports car) and I totaled one car and got about 6 tickets.<P>&lt;I've had a total of 2 points though and they are gone now&gt;<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Formulasigs.JPG"> ||||reg||1
